Shama Speaker

A browser-based prototype for practicing a presentation or spoken response.

What it demonstrates

A focused browser interaction rather than a generic AI landing page

Front-end prototyping and user-flow design

A foundation for future speech, timing, and feedback features

Run locally

Because this is a static prototype:

python -m http.server 8000

Then open http://localhost:8000.

Status

Prototype. The current repository is a demonstration project, not a maintained production speech product.

